#: scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f49be74e02762b9829cc0ac0637b1ee159e6a58925bfc4c77e279b01aed34646
#. default-sha256: c6f0e57d373a07d146c4f11218ce8a1ee5c0b0a8b0fdda89c06c1464d77cc810
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t work on some nobleman’s estate,⟪k:1⟫but instead, I did physical labor—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"construction work.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I built roads and buildings, tore down hills and mountains."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人の屋敷で働く類の奴隷ではなく、⟪k:1⟫街道を作る時や建物を作る時……それから山を切り崩す時に使わ"
"れた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f8c818281fbaf0369deede9534d97d59269bea72193ff2a14f4974acd006ad3
#. default-sha256: 4e353fc66267f1430c39a7cf959b7710b01c60450d508d132cdcedd589892eae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I doubt I need to tell you this, living conditions were miserable. ⟪k:1⟫Other "
"slaves withered away and died on a daily basis."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫敢えて言うまでもないが……ひどい生活だった。⟪k:1⟫他の奴隷は衰弱して死に絶えていく。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4a490e1fa93fc67491d93b37d63fd33ce8fa9e57b3e356a71e0e9e524c64d63
#. default-sha256: 344818384fa06ae611435086f3b5eed83365572ad64a9136b648aa1d37a57551
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Working a noble’s estate would have been easier, without a doubt,⟪k:1⟫if only for the fact I "
"would have a specific master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まだ……どこぞの屋敷で飼われていた方が、⟪k:1⟫主がいる分、⟪k:2⟫良かったのかもしれないな。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f9a64b9c634332745f2a6e348c23556db3233fe4e8e4752661f33adec5cf158
#. default-sha256: dfe551fd03534ae834e56c2a3b484903c65d8e73b7995d5427315e2c8dc75846
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t remember anything about my life before becoming a slave.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I have are "
"those few images, from which I can guess I was part of a caravan,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫奴隷をやる前の記憶はなく……、⟪k:1⟫おぼろげに覚えていることから辿るに、⟪k:2⟫俺はどこかの商隊に"
"属していたか――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1facb03f9208f5b5947daeb77fb4f58e898ee3214deeb6c2eddb930163c511c9
#. default-sha256: 30d6878343d8bf976abb4dfc0363f2b9a2240d56ee98f78a576453f98f69b7fb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I next woke up, I had been stripped bare and was surrounded by men I didn’t recognize. "
"⟪k:1⟫The words they spoke were gibberish to my ears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫気づいた時には身包みを剥がされていて、⟪k:1⟫周りには見知らぬ男たちがいた。⟪k:2⟫そいつらが口々"
"に叫ぶ言葉は、⟪k:3⟫何ひとつ理解出来なかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c8dec2b7b20f597e8d8cccb7652ced8bbeebc8f426be965f7e8df03a970f9b
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea9053b45828a9eba7884f063110a7ca76166fad8f11995055cfb67c549e97d1
#. default-sha256: 00e0bebb86a872cd6ac3df972dc23cab964fbb6b2cdb831de57573ea6ffe32f5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, I came to learn their language—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though I can only speak it; ⟪k:4⟫I "
"don’t know how to read or write."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……俺は今でも読み書きはほとんど出来ないが、⟪k:1⟫奴隷として過ごすうちに、⟪k:2⟫奴らの話す言葉か"
"ら学ぶことは出来た。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 939500218952f1d9ad5ebf87a61450c743cc337523bed6df91c8c161c01e6e9f
#. default-sha256: 7a9b7ecb23b1e5619357b58d56ad1e3ebec4efdb6081681f2c1e51ac5fd5d2e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A darkness grew inside me with each repeated insult.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wanted to make them pay for "
"the daily abuse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫虐げられる日々の中、⟪k:1⟫俺の胸の内側にはどす黒いものが溜まっていった。⟪k:2⟫奴らに牙を剥いて"
"やりたかったのさ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27d026d471d358df0de9b3092bb6803ea528d7d1db05d0eb8a5bf008b60a95e7
#. default-sha256: cdb3b09f0e353a567ab2a5da242028d4edf37e47aae9c93a8cee8e28286c4425
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And who wouldn’t? The desire to exact vengeance when you’ve been mistreated is only natural. "
"It’s perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それは当然の感情だろう？　⟪k:1⟫俺を虐げた者どもに復讐をし、⟪k:2⟫同じか――それ以上の苦痛を味わ"
"わせてやりたいと思うのは……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82c711a9d0dd4e19e376dd9bb1d612cb7df06fcd7128c5d1075a9a56b039766a
#. default-sha256: b3217b07afcf3d0d17b7ad340b01d42df77a6a10253465f6be47219fab7a4ac2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They looked like me a year earlier: ⟪k:1⟫deprived of food and water and beaten into "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初の頃の俺と同じさ……、⟪k:1⟫食うものや飲むものを奪われ、⟪k:2⟫暴力を受ければ、⟪k:3⟫大人しくな"
"らざるを得ない。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 548908370dba46809ec4c6db3c37afd13972b34f4691e8535571961f6bd42b7c
#. default-sha256: f3a053cf06b2090a4bfad7c1728dfd820ab0b9d3f022cd0fb5b10d33fbedf32d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting beside me was a young girl, crying in silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その中で、⟪k:1⟫声もあげずに涙を流している少女がいたんだ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫俺の隣にじっと座っていて……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4294ca39d31d70c4f70c2e3fe6f5701159c3c6ba2b75bf0a067f914d9e89af63
#. default-sha256: f9421e93a945425ea2d3f04e0c82bf4f5d637bfe90255f4cb13d6128c750a4b3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫perhaps because I had a similarly unusual appearance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What caught my attention, "
"though, was the way she was crying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫俺も周囲から見れば、⟪k:1⟫奇妙な外見をしているのだろうからな。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ただ気になったのは……そ"
"いつの泣き方だ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13a2db85a0b4d0eea8c213101da119c4e77c3d36144c32e425b3b44d71495eaf
#. default-sha256: 38a2e03b4476f835a39b269fc13c86cb6a1f82e6c6d11d8fe9a1cf28cf759268
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, I still don’t understand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今でも……あの時の言葉が、⟪k:1⟫俺には理解出来ん……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61137eca3977d1d1f5c90457d111f0c9dfb7de2bad579207003fa0bcb8420781
#. default-sha256: 509c0dbc47af6997cf8e198d4953f15815ff7f31e101afd131b3f931f2d4ec92
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I took action, driven by that desire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その瞬間はそれを思って……、⟪k:1⟫行動に出たんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2ae8d3f60bc84eda3c4bc0e846da7afd2fa0b0c6538f2f124269fa3ebb24d66
#. default-sha256: b7dada06503d311a66d9dd827718816cbbb12a4dda017a618cb37cf94d29fb05
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫No... ⟪k:4⟫no, don’t kill me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫や……、⟪k:3⟫やめろ……、⟪k:4⟫こ、⟪k:5⟫殺さないでくれ……ッ！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9166C886_262C_4544_AD28_298AE84AB18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faa0bb4ef96921256af35b18bca8b2bf7642b392476b540c115e2469854e2996
#. default-sha256: 9b9c9ebb955dbece52336f6e3ba83eebd20fe37a1129774f74bf7f00e99a10ea
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9166C886_262C_4544_AD28_298AE84AB18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Haha..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………はは………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A894CB19_55BF_49D4_A0D2_89C365A1867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17eb2907453d0aa499bfeb78800fecc96282ef993536ea8ed9047dc5be482f20
#. default-sha256: 37bf60ea2613d56f6a371d576dacca579f70b469b0d9bc86b2f2d12842649aa4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A894CB19_55BF_49D4_A0D2_89C365A1867B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Heh heh... ⟪k:1⟫heh heh heh...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫hahahaha... ⟪k:4⟫AAAAAAAHAHAHAHA!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ふふ……、⟪k:1⟫ふふッ……はははは……、⟪k:2⟫アァッハハハハ……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88411f70d4cc7a6c0d68c0f6094f3a153191abc0b58d8d06ac8f4bc66e89b887
#. default-sha256: e4087131376f0ceee72388ab5f49a5f163e267c5c51cad0b0895ab6f904fc35a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I have a wife... ⟪k:2⟫and children! Please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お、⟪k:1⟫俺には……妻も子供もいて……、⟪k:2⟫だから………！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3686fac25e278e8b8163f91e0c6218fa6dd1354a5ccd1f8fb33be062abf2c8bb
#. default-sha256: f5517f988a746d11ed799c6857aeaac80eea255afb965cbee5098fb9f924fd4c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even with the shackles still around my wrists, I had little trouble slaughtering the slave "
"traders and their guards."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫枷をつけられた制限があっても――、⟪k:1⟫俺は奴隷商も護衛の男たちも殺しつくすことが出来たんだ"
"よ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4006972c6d6655d50e6b979e09639822fb4f18356f3f81a3738354a328dc9a78
#. default-sha256: 6fb972bcb97852a6f705728428334e226e827e71a40620d9a1e60d03fdd3dc7d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? No one can defeat me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰も……俺に勝てなかったぞ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_965C61DA_0A90_4324_BF7B_37434EA96B28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
