#: scenario8:scenario8_D2028BE3_1C49_4685_9BA6_05D8B7988A70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: babaa518e78e06fff4059c6694cf84ce600d25d464eb36ebbe822ac8e0152ac4
