msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hahahahahahah... ⟪k:1⟫hee, ⟪k:2⟫heehee, ⟪k:3⟫ahaha, ⟪k:4⟫hahahaha!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ははははははッ……、⟪k:1⟫ひ、⟪k:2⟫ひひッ、⟪k:3⟫あはッ、⟪k:4⟫はははは……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_146F5F6C_B470_4D37_810A_EE5AD2905462
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 740bf589bba9848a0f43128675b7a9e8eae12cb3aa854d2d3fe6eb98afd15d40
